  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with multiprofile data and avgpool aggregation (config_018) achieve the highest validation accuracy (0.6186). However, the RNA encoder (pca_n2000) used in config_018 has not been directly compared to other encoders like scvi_n200, which performed moderately in RNA-only settings (config_002). This experiment tests whether switching to scvi_n200 RNA encoder in the high-performing multimodal setup isolates the impact of RNA representation, a critical design choice. It balances exploitation of the current top-performing configuration while exploring a key variable (RNA encoder) that may significantly influence performance."
